Establish `hcast : ((densAt σ ϖ S T k : ℝ) : ℂ) = (solCount σ ϖ S T k : ℂ) * (Nat.card (hermMod σ ϖ n k) : ℂ) / (Nat.card (Matrix (Fin m) (Fin n) (R ⧸ lev ϖ k)) : ℂ)`. Unfold `densAt`. Rewrite using `[Complex.ofReal_div, Complex.ofReal_mul, Complex.ofReal_natCast, Complex.ofReal_natCast, Complex.ofReal_natCast]`. Rewrite using `[hfin, hcast, eq_div_iff hM]`. Take the linear combination `(-1 : ℂ) * hcount`.
